-- 1) passages
-- ============================================================

INSERT INTO passages (part_type, passage_body) VALUES
(5, 'The manager asked the team to finish the report before the deadline.'),
(5, 'The new software is expected to reduce processing time significantly.'),
(5, 'Because the shipment was delayed, the customer became upset.'),
(5, 'The company is preparing for a major expansion into overseas markets.'),
(5, 'The meeting was postponed until next Monday because of bad weather.'),
(5, 'We can offer a discount if you sign the contract this week.'),
(5, 'The office will be closed for renovation during the summer.'),
(5, 'Please confirm whether you received the package yesterday.'),
(5, 'The engineers completed the project ahead of schedule.'),
(5, 'The sales department has been working long hours this month.'),

(6, 'The company announced that it would expand its operations in Singapore next year. The decision follows strong demand from customers in the region and a steady increase in online sales.'),
(6, 'A new recycling program was introduced at the headquarters last month. Employees are asked to separate paper, plastic, and metal before placing them in the proper bins.'),
(6, 'The engineering team completed a safety inspection of the warehouse before reopening it to staff. A report was then sent to management for approval.'),
(6, 'The bookstore is offering a limited-time discount on travel guides this week. Customers can also receive a free tote bag with each purchase.'),

(7, 'To: All Sales Staff
From: Marketing Team
Subject: Customer Feedback Review

Dear Team,

Thank you for your recent efforts in improving customer satisfaction. We have reviewed the latest feedback reports and found that many customers are pleased with the speed of our response, but some are concerned about the delay in product delivery.

Because of this, we will begin a pilot program in the Tokyo and Osaka branches. The pilot will focus on improving delivery tracking and updating customers more frequently during the shipping process. We will also ask each branch to contact customers if deliveries are delayed by more than three days.

Please make sure that all customer service representatives have access to the new tracking system before the end of the month. We will send a short training session schedule next week.

Thank you for your cooperation.
Marketing Team'),

(7, 'To: All Staff
From: Human Resources
Subject: Annual Health Checkups

Dear Employees,

This year’s annual health checkups will be held in the company gym from May 10 to May 18. You may schedule an appointment through the online portal or by contacting the HR desk directly.

If you are currently taking medication or have any condition that may require special attention, please note this in the appointment form. The medical staff will provide appropriate guidance after your checkup.

Employees who do not complete the checkup by May 18 will receive a reminder email. We strongly encourage all staff members to participate, as the results will help us improve workplace wellness and safety.

Thank you for your cooperation.
Human Resources Department'),

(7, 'To: Customer Service Team
From: Operations Manager
Subject: Revised Return Policy

Dear Team,

We have updated our return policy to make the process clearer and more efficient for customers. Beginning next Monday, customers will be able to request a return or exchange within 30 days of purchase, provided that the item is in its original condition and the receipt is available.

If a customer requests a return without a receipt, the staff member should first check the purchase record in the system. If no record is found, the customer may be asked to provide additional information before the request is approved.

Please remind customers that refunds will be processed within five business days after the returned item is received. For damaged items, the customer service team should forward the case to the quality assurance department immediately.

Thank you for your attention.
Operations Manager'),

(7, 'To: Project Team
From: Project Lead
Subject: Updated Meeting Schedule

Dear Team,

I would like to thank everyone for the work completed so far on the new client portal. The project is progressing well, and we have completed most of the design reviews.

However, we discovered a few issues in the testing phase, especially in the payment and account settings. These problems are expected to be resolved before the end of this week. In the meantime, please avoid making changes to the payment screen without checking with the project lead.

The next team meeting will be held on Friday at 2:00 p.m. in Conference Room B. We will review the remaining tasks and confirm the final launch date. If you are unable to attend, please send a brief update to the project lead before Thursday noon.

Thank you.
Project Lead');

