(13, 6, 'Why was the inspection done?', 'To improve productivity', 'To ensure safety', 'To reduce staffing', 'To increase advertising', 'B', 'The passage focuses on a safety inspection.'),
(13, 6, 'Who reviewed the report?', 'The management', 'The customers', 'The suppliers', 'The employees', 'A', 'The report was sent to management for approval.'),
(14, 6, 'What is being offered this week?', 'A limited-time discount on travel guides', 'A free hotel voucher', 'A free membership', 'A gift certificate', 'A', 'The bookstore is offering a limited-time discount on travel guides.'),
